      "message": "Also, a general question maybe more for Furquan.  Why is it we don\u0027t check the return on this function for S3 entry in Intel?  Are there platforms or powerdown scenarios where we wouldn\u0027t expect it to contain HOST_SLEEP_EVENT_S3_SUSPEND for S3 transition?",
